<title>UK: Sidlaw Q1 sales volumes ahead of 1995/96.</title>
<headline>Sidlaw Q1 sales volumes ahead of 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging firm Sidlaw Group Plc said on Tuesday that sales volumes in the first quarter were ahead of the same period in 1995/96.</p>
<p>&quot;Since the year end, the improvement in operating performance seen in the six months to 30 September 1996 has been maintained,&quot; chairman Michael Walker told the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
